rk and files</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Logos & Icons')" data-page-id="381891715"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Logos and icons</strong><span>Use supplied artwork unchanged. Choose the variant for your background and output.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Partner logos')" data-page-id="$page.id"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Partner logos</strong><span>Logos for programmes the SKAO runs with its partners, starting with the SKA Regional Centre Network (SRCNet).</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Font Downloads')" data-page-id="381891882"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Fonts</strong><span>Use Noto Sans for the SKAO identity, with Verdana as the fallback.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'SKAO Brand Book')" data-page-id="381891631"><span class="dir-text"><strong>SKAO Brand Book</strong><span>The Brand Book is the detailed source for visual identity rules.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="dir-group"><h2>Using the brand</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Logo Usage and Downloads')" data-page-id="381891626"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Using the SKAO logo</strong><span>Use official artwork, preserve its proportions and give it space.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Colour Palette and Typography')" data-page-id="381891623"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Colours and typography</strong><span>Official values from the SKAO Brand Book (March 2022). Copy what you need: hex or RGB for screen, CMYK or Pantone for print.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Brand in Practice')" data-page-id="381891610"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Apply the brand</strong><span>Use the existing templates and artwork to keep your work recognisably SKAO.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="dir-group"><h2>Partner brands</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')" data-page-id="381891614"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Co-branding with CSIRO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and CSIRO identities.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="dir-row" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding SARAO')" data-page-id="381891619"><span class="dir-text"><strong>Co-branding with SARAO</strong><span>Guidance for material that carries both the SKAO and SARAO identities.</span></span></a></li></ul></section></div></div><aside class="landing-rail" aria-label="Help with this section"><div class="rail-guides"><h2 class="rail-title">Before you start</h2><details class="rail-item" data-kind="info" open><summary><span class="rail-label">Working with partner brands</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><section class="landing-note"><p>Use the current guidance for the specific partner and application. Do not assemble a new logo lock-up from memory.</p><p class="rail-links"><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding CSIRO')" class="">CSIRO co-branding</a><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Co-Branding SARAO')" class="">SARAO co-branding</a></p></section></div></details><details class="rail-item" data-kind="ask"><summary><span class="rail-label">Need a second pair of eyes?</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><aside class="next-step"><div><p>Include the draft, intended use and partner requirements.</p></div><p class="rail-links"><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="text-link">Ask about the brand <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></aside></div></details></div></aside></div>
