cifications, dimensions and delivery requirements.</li><li>Content owner, proof reviewer and budget approval.</li><li>Supplier lead time and the final artwork deadline.</li><li>Applicable safety requirements with the event organiser and HSSE.</li></ul></section></section></div></details><details class="rail-item" data-kind="info"><summary><span class="rail-label">Event safety</span></summary><div class="rail-body"><section class="reading-section"><p>The event organiser and the SKAO HSSE team confirm safety requirements and approvals. Include any design or material needs in the creative brief.</p><p class="rail-links"><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/298" class="">Open the HSSE helpdesk <span class="arr arr-out" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></section></div></details></div></aside></div>
