<div hidden data-dl-groups="[{&quot;group&quot;: &quot;SKAO\u2013SARAO&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;With the South African Radio Astronomy Observatory&quot;, &quot;match&quot;: &quot;sarao&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Presentation template&quot;}, {&quot;group&quot;: &quot;SRCNet&quot;, &quot;note&quot;: &quot;For the SKA Regional Centre Network&quot;, &quot;match&quot;: &quot;rcn|srcnet&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Presentation template&quot;}]"></div><div class="task-intro asset-panel" data-page-id="$page.id"><div class="asset-art slides" aria-hidden="true"><span class="art-slide"><i>SKA Observatory</i><b>A shared story.</b></span></div><div class="asset-info"><span class="eyebrow">Presentation</span><p class="asset-purpose">Presentation templates for joint work with SKAO partners.</p><dl class="asset-facts"><div class="how-to-get"><dt>Availability</dt><dd>Not yet available to download. The files appear here once they are approved.</dd></div><div data-fact="format"><dt>Format</dt><dd>PowerPoint (.pptx), 16:9; the SRCNet template also comes as Keynote (.key)</dd></div><div data-fact="partners"><dt>Partners</dt><dd><ul class="variant-list"><li>SKAO–SARAO</li><li>SRCNet</li></ul></dd></div><div data-fact="version" class="release-fact" hidden><dt>Version</dt><dd></dd></div><div data-fact="updated" class="release-fact" hidden><dt>Last updated</dt><dd></dd></div><div data-fact="approved" class="release-fact" hidden><dt>Approved by</dt><dd>Communications</dd></div></dl><div class="asset-actions"><a class="text-link" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Formatting a Presentation')">How to format a presentation</a></div><div class="asset-downloads" data-downloads hidden></div></div></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>Before you use the file</h2><ul><li>Use a partner template only for work you are producing with that partner.</li><li>Co-branded material needs approval from Communications before it is shared.</li><li>Keep the partner’s logo and layout as supplied.</li></ul></section><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Presentations"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Presentations</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Slide Decks & Presentations')">Prepare a presentation <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'About SKAO Master Deck')"><strong>Decks to reuse</strong><span>Approved decks to reuse and adapt: an introduction to the SKAO, the science case, construction progress across both sites, and decks on specialised topics.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'SKA-Low Overview')"><strong>SKA-Low progress</strong><span>Where SKA-Low construction stands: the live status slides and the progress decks the SKA-Low team shares here.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'SKA-Mid Overview')"><strong>SKA-Mid progress</strong><span>Where SKA-Mid construction stands: the live status slides and the progress decks the SKA-Mid team shares here.</span></a></div></nav>
