the supplied artwork unchanged, as with the SKAO logo.</li><li>Co-branded SKAO–CSIRO and SKAO–SARAO logos are supplied by Communications once a use is approved.</li></ul></section><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Brand"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Brand</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Brand Guidelines')">Brand guidance <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Font Downloads')"><strong>Fonts</strong><span>Use Noto Sans for the SKAO identity, with Verdana as the fallback.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'SKAO Brand Book')"><strong>SKAO Brand Book</strong><span>The Brand Book is the detailed source for visual identity rules.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Logo Usage and Downloads')"><strong>Using the SKAO logo</strong><span>Use official artwork, preserve its proportions and give it space.</span></a></div></nav>
